                <pb facs="0650" n="554" xml:id="pg554"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Merry to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-02-27"><hi rendition="#italic">February 27,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The capital of Mosquito Territory has been captured by the Government of
                    Nicaragua. United States, English naval forces landed temporarily.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Merry.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
